<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Waqas Saleem | DevOps Engineer</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(0, 255, 200, 0.08) 0%, transparent 40%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 80%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12) 0%, transparent 40%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #05060a 0%, #0b0f19 50%, #05060a 100%);
      color: #e2e8f0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 720px;
      width: 100%;
      background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.55);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 200, 0.15);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 44px;
      box-shadow:
        0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02),
        0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6),
        0 0 40px rgba(0, 255, 200, 0.05);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .container::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -2px;
      left: -2px;
      right: -2px;
      height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #00ffc8, #8b5cf6, transparent);
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(0, 255, 200, 0.08);
      color: #00ffc8;
      padding: 7px 16px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 200, 0.3);
      text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 255, 200, 0.6);
    }

    .badge::before {
      content: "";
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #00ffc8;
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px #00ffc8;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00ffc8, #8b5cf6, #38bdf8);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;
    }

    .subtitle::before {
      content: "> ";
      color: #00ffc8;
    }

    .about {
      background: rgba(5, 8, 15, 0.6);
      border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
      border-left: 3px solid #8b5cf6;
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .skills {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .skill {
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08);
      color: #67e8f9;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .skill:hover {
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.18);
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
    }

    .status-box {
      background: rgba(0, 255, 200, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 200, 0.25);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      background: #00ffc8;
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px #00ffc8;
      animation: pulse 1.6s infinite;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
      50% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(0.85); }
      100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    }

    .status-text {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: #a7f3d0;
      font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;
    }

    .status-text b {
      color: #00ffc8;
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 255, 200, 0.4);
    }

    .contact {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .contact a {
      color: #67e8f9;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .contact a:hover {
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 32px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 11.5px;
      color: #475569;
      font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .container {
        padding: 28px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 1.9rem;
      }

      .about {
        font-size: 0.88rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <span class="badge">DevOps Engineer</span>
    <h1>Waqas Saleem</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Automating infrastructure, one pipeline at a time.</p>

    <div class="about">
      My passion lies in Cloud &amp; DevOps — I work with Kubernetes, Docker,
      Jenkins CI/CD, Ansible automation, and GitOps (Helm + Argo CD).
      This page itself is part of that automated deployment pipeline,
      generated using Ansible roles and Jinja2 templates.
    </div>

    <div class="skills">
      <span class="skill">AWS EC2</span>
      <span class="skill">Docker</span>
      <span class="skill">Kubernetes</span>
      <span class="skill">Ansible</span>
      <span class="skill">Jenkins</span>
      <span class="skill">Helm &amp; Argo CD</span>
      <span class="skill">NGINX</span>
      <span class="skill">MySQL</span>
    </div>

    <div class="status-box">
      <span class="dot"></span>
      <span class="status-text">
        Database connected as <b>{{ mysql_user }}</b> to <b>myappdb</b>
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="contact">
      <a href="https://github.com/Ranawaqas323421" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
      <a href="mailto:rw178722@gmail.com">Email</a>
      <a href="https://hub.docker.com/u/waqas323421" target="_blank">Docker Hub</a>
    </div>

    <footer>Deployed via Ansible // Server: {{ inventory_hostname }}</footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
